<title>UK: AfDB prices 30 billion yen five-year bond.</title>
<headline>AfDB prices 30 billion yen five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was priced by</p>
<p>lead manager Goldman Sachs.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AFRICAN DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    30 BLN YEN    COUPON     1.85	MATURITY    07.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.896    PAY DATE    07.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     REOFFER    99.896    SPREAD	+22 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 100-1M-10M SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  15 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 148 JGB</p>
<p> NOTES	SUBORDINATED EUROBOND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
